    "description": "Entirely synthetic Zava Security Texas fleet analytics (Zava Security is a fictional company) over the existing tx-fleet-command SQL Database OneLake replica. Read-only analytical model; no real company records, live tracking, recipient delivery or production guarantees. Current alert state and frozen telemetry scenario time are distinct.",
